    <string name="settings_about_text">Addon manager for the WoW Forever client on Android. It installs only Forever builds (TOC _Forever / _Camelot, interface 16001), keeps them up to date and touches nothing in the game except Interface/AddOns.\n\nGamepad: L1/R1 switch tabs, X checks for updates, Y opens search, B goes back.</string>
